whole::a Explore a graph in the canvas ::e
read::a Read every participant of an event ::e --::P--> whole
read --> next::a Walk to the next place ::e
next --::P--> whole

you::a Canvas reader --> read, next
part::a the participant --> read, next
spot::a the place beside this event --> read
badge::a its 2/3 badge --> next

you --> Reader ::c
part --> node ::c
spot --> place ::c
badge --> place ::c
